<title>USA: Mosaix sets 1.7 million share buyback.</title>
<headline>Mosaix sets 1.7 million share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mosaix Inc said the board has authorized the repurchase of up to 1.7 million shares of common stock of the company.</p>
<p>The shares repurchased may be used to service the Company's employee benefit plans and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Under previous programs authorized by the board of directors in prior years, the company has repurchased 691,000 shares.</p>
